00:16:58,058 --> 00:17:01,687
Ang gusto ko 'yung anak ko…
mag-mukhang anak ko, 'yun lang.

225
00:17:02,938 --> 00:17:06,608
Panganay… at tagapag-mana ng Jaeyul Group.

226
00:17:14,199 --> 00:17:15,325
Sumunod ka agad.

227
00:17:30,841 --> 00:17:33,177
JOOSHIN HIGH HAS MORE APPLICANTS IN 2024

228
00:18:49,753 --> 00:18:52,840
Ano, - umm, - may gig ako dito.

229
00:18:53,882 --> 00:18:55,509
Ako 'yung nasa piano kanina.

230
00:18:59,638 --> 00:19:03,267
Ah kasi - nag-break - lang 'ko
saglit pero - pabalik na 'ko.

231
00:19:03,934 --> 00:19:04,768
Iwan na kita.

232
00:19:09,481 --> 00:19:11,859
Pwede mong - gamitin 'to - kung gusto mo.

233
00:19:13,694 --> 00:19:14,695
Hindi, ayoko.

234
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:17,531
Hubarin mo 'yang polo mo.

235
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:20,075
Ha?

236
00:19:20,659 --> 00:19:22,953
'Yang suot mo. 'Yan ang kailangan ko.

237
00:19:23,287 --> 00:19:24,163
Ah, ito?

238
00:19:24,246 --> 00:19:27,749
May kailangan akong puntahan,
hindi pwede 'tong suot ko ngayon.

239
00:19:29,042 --> 00:19:31,170
Ah, oo nga, pero kasi…

240
00:19:32,004 --> 00:19:33,297
Ano kasi… pa'no 'ko…

241
00:19:34,006 --> 00:19:36,133
babalik do'n… kung huhubarin ko to--

242
00:19:38,302 --> 00:19:39,386
Teka, sandali lang.

243
00:19:55,402 --> 00:19:56,320
Naisip ko lang…

244
00:19:58,113 --> 00:20:00,449
baka mas kailangan mo ke sa sa 'kin 'to.

245
00:20:08,790 --> 00:20:09,708
Hala, anlamig.

246
00:20:29,144 --> 00:20:31,688
Di sila natatakot? Ba't
gusto nila ng ganito?

247
00:20:33,982 --> 00:20:35,150
'Di ko nga rin gets, eh.

248
00:20:36,485 --> 00:20:39,154
Masarap sa feeling, eh.
Parang buhay na buhay ako.

249
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,365
Jung Jae-i!

250
00:20:44,785 --> 00:20:45,619
Long time no see.

251
00:20:47,371 --> 00:20:49,373
-Na-miss kita, Jae-i.
-Kumusta ka na?

252
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:53,126
'Yang outfit mo ngayon - kakaiba, ah.

253
00:21:26,827 --> 00:21:29,079
O bakit? Hayaan mo sila?

254
00:21:32,332 --> 00:21:35,752
Grabe, - tagal na nung huli
tayong nakumpleto. Sa'n tayo after?

255
00:21:36,336 --> 00:21:38,130
Dapat lang siguro… mag-enjoy tayo today?

256
00:21:38,213 --> 00:21:39,047
Jung Jae-i.

257
00:21:41,091 --> 00:21:43,051
Wala ka bang sasabihin sa 'kin?

258
00:21:45,929 --> 00:21:46,805
He-ra.

259
00:21:47,014 --> 00:21:47,556
Ha?

260
00:21:48,390 --> 00:21:50,267
Makikipagpustahan ako kay Ri-an.

261
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:52,978
Pustahan? Ano'ng nakataya?

262
00:21:53,061 --> 00:21:54,604
Makukuha ng panalo ang wish n'ya.

263
00:21:55,856 --> 00:21:56,606
Ano'ng wish?

264
00:21:58,317 --> 00:21:59,234
Hintayin mo.

265
00:22:00,235 --> 00:22:03,030
Tatlong laps,
ako sa pole. Walang pwedeng umangal…

266
00:22:03,113 --> 00:22:04,781
anuman ang kalabasan nito.

267
00:22:04,865 --> 00:22:06,033
Kung mananalo ka.

268
00:22:06,616 --> 00:22:07,659
Pero kung hindi naman…

269
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:13,040
'yung mga pinag-gagagawa
mo… ipapaliwanag mo lahat.

270
00:24:15,203 --> 00:24:17,330
Hala, ano na 'to? - Okay lang sila?

271
00:24:18,874 --> 00:24:19,875
Kailangan ganyan?

272
00:24:20,709 --> 00:24:21,293
Ewan.

273
00:26:15,198 --> 00:26:19,202
Ano ka ba? Ba't gano'n ka
magmaneho, ha? Pa'no kung nasa ka?

274
00:26:19,286 --> 00:26:20,537
Panalo ako.

275
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:23,123
Ako ang nanalo rito.

276
00:26:24,833 --> 00:26:28,712
'Yung gusto ko… sasabihin ko na.

277
00:26:31,923 --> 00:26:34,134
Mag-break na tayo, - Kim Ri-an.

278
00:26:51,568 --> 00:26:52,444
He-ra.

279
00:26:52,694 --> 00:26:54,237
-Bakit?
-Tara na.

280
00:26:58,158 --> 00:27:01,369
Teka nga. Ano ba kasing
nangyari bago s'ya nag-America?

281
00:27:02,495 --> 00:27:03,413
Malay ko.

282
00:27:04,122 --> 00:27:05,165
Hindi ko rin alam.

283
00:27:06,583 --> 00:27:08,668
Ngayon ko lang sila nakitang ganyan.

284
00:27:12,922 --> 00:27:13,840
Ano'ng sabi mo?

285
00:27:15,425 --> 00:27:17,844
Break na tayo. - Tapos na 'to.

286
00:27:18,762 --> 00:27:19,971
At ano'ng dahilan mo?

287
00:27:21,431 --> 00:27:23,516
Teka, ba't ka ba kasi nagkakaganyan?

288
00:27:24,684 --> 00:27:26,269
Ano~? Nanlamig ka na lang bigla,

289
00:27:26,353 --> 00:27:29,272
umalis ng walang paalam ta's
babalik ka after two-- hindi,

290
00:27:29,356 --> 00:27:31,024
three months nang gano'n na lang?

291
00:27:31,107 --> 00:27:33,026
Ta's 'yan ang unang sasabihin mo?

292
00:27:34,194 --> 00:27:36,696
Six years old tayo
nung una tayong nagkita.

293
00:27:37,113 --> 00:27:41,576
At nung summer na nag-15 tayo, sabi
mo unang kita pa lang gusto mo na 'ko.

294
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:45,205
Bakit?

295
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:48,124
Bakit mo 'ko nagustuhan?

296
00:27:48,208 --> 00:27:50,168
Walang specific na
dahilan. Basta ang alam ko lang--

297
00:27:50,251 --> 00:27:51,878
Ayun na nga. Walang dahilan.

298
00:27:52,879 --> 00:27:54,839
Pagdating sa gusto o hindi gusto…

299
00:27:55,382 --> 00:27:57,175
wala namang kahit anong dahilan.

300
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:58,593
Teka!

301
00:28:00,387 --> 00:28:01,554
Let's be friends.

302
00:28:02,597 --> 00:28:04,057
Magkaibigan na lang tayo.

303
00:28:05,433 --> 00:28:07,310
Ako'ng nanalo.

304
00:28:08,478 --> 00:28:10,063
Walang aangal. 'Yun ang usapan.

305
00:28:10,146 --> 00:28:11,064
Teka, Jae-i.

306
00:28:12,232 --> 00:28:13,191
Hoy, Jung Jae-i!

307
00:28:14,484 --> 00:28:15,318
Shit!

308
00:28:41,428 --> 00:28:43,680
-'Yung kamay ni Ri-an, o.
-'Di ba~? Ano kaya'ng nangyari?

309
00:28:43,763 --> 00:28:44,806
Bakit nga kaya?

310
00:28:46,558 --> 00:28:49,144
Malay ko. May nangyari
ba sa kanya? Alam mo?

311
00:28:51,479 --> 00:28:55,066
Ang astig ah. 'Yung bad boy
image n'ya mas sumexy pa, ah.

312
00:28:55,608 --> 00:28:57,318
'Yung bandage sa kamay n'ya, nakita mo?

313
00:28:57,402 --> 00:28:58,319
Na-injure s'ya?

314
00:29:01,448 --> 00:29:03,116
Jae-i. Rooibos.

315
00:29:04,743 --> 00:29:05,744
Thank you.

316
00:29:05,827 --> 00:29:07,912
Kahapon… nakauwi ka naman ng maayos?

317
00:29:09,998 --> 00:29:12,375
Mukhang na-hurt talaga si
Ri-an. May nangyari ba after naming--

318
00:29:12,459 --> 00:29:13,209
He-ra.

319
00:29:14,419 --> 00:29:15,545
Ayoko sanang pag-usapan.

320
00:29:18,256 --> 00:29:20,133
Okay. Mamaya na lang.

321
00:29:44,824 --> 00:29:47,160
Wala tayong special announcements today.

322
00:29:47,410 --> 00:29:51,164
Ngayong linggo ang deadline kung meron
sa inyong kailangang magpalit ng klase.

323
00:29:51,247 --> 00:29:53,625
Gawin natin lahat para sa
matagumpay na pag-aaral sa semester na

324
00:29:53,708 --> 00:29:54,626
-'to.
-Uy.

325
00:29:54,709 --> 00:29:57,754
Mag-aral kayong mabuti sa
classes n'yo ngayong araw.

326
00:29:59,756 --> 00:30:02,258
Class president, pwede
ka bang makausap sandali?

327
00:30:06,721 --> 00:30:08,723
Magtse-cello ka ba? Flute ako.

328
00:30:08,807 --> 00:30:11,851
Malamang cello na lang ako. Wala
akong oras na… isabay pa'ng flute.

329
00:30:11,935 --> 00:30:14,020
Excuse me. May itatanong lang ako.

330
00:30:14,103 --> 00:30:16,314
Pa'no nag-a-apply magpalit ng klase?

331
00:30:16,439 --> 00:30:17,273
Ano?

332
00:30:17,816 --> 00:30:20,360
Napansin kong meron palang rowing at
fencing, pero wala sa schedule ko.

333
00:30:20,443 --> 00:30:22,070
Bakit sa 'kin mo tinatanong 'yan?

334
00:30:23,321 --> 00:30:25,532
D'yan ka magtanong sa mga kaibigan mo.

335
00:30:25,824 --> 00:30:26,741
"Kaibigan"?

336
00:30:32,622 --> 00:30:33,957
Excuse me.

337
00:30:34,040 --> 00:30:34,958
Ano na naman?

338
00:30:35,041 --> 00:30:37,544
Kung magpapalit ng
schedule - sa'n pupunta?

339
00:30:38,169 --> 00:30:40,255
Schedule ng events para sa semester.

340
00:30:42,674 --> 00:30:43,675
Ju-won.

341
00:30:44,259 --> 00:30:46,052
Pwede bang ikaw bahala sa bagong student?

342
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:47,136
Ikaw ang class president.

343
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:50,849
- Asikasuhin mo s'ya para maging
maayos ang transition n'ya.

344
00:30:50,932 --> 00:30:52,392
Para 'yung nangyari dati…

345
00:30:53,685 --> 00:30:54,686
hindi na maulit pa.

346
00:30:57,939 --> 00:30:59,023
Yes, miss.

347
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:06,072
-Mm~.
-Kapal ba ng makeup ko?

348
00:31:06,155 --> 00:31:08,074
-Mukhang okay lang naman.
-I concur.

349
00:31:08,157 --> 00:31:09,492
-Something's different kasi, e~.
-Tinanong mo si Jae-I

350
00:31:09,576 --> 00:31:11,703
-kung ano'ng problema?
-'Yung lips mo parang iba I guess~?

351
00:31:11,786 --> 00:31:12,704
Walang dahilan.

352
00:31:12,787 --> 00:31:14,706
Pagdating sa gusto o hindi gusto…

353
00:31:15,999 --> 00:31:17,876
wala namang kahit anong dahilan.

354
00:31:18,376 --> 00:31:19,586
Ano'ng lipstick mo?

355
00:31:19,669 --> 00:31:22,714
Dinala ko lahat today except
lipstick. 'Yun lang nalimutan ko.

356
00:31:22,797 --> 00:31:23,673
Kaya~.

357
00:31:23,882 --> 00:31:26,426
Ako rin, kaya I don't know kung
bakit 'yon pa ang nalimutan ko.

358
00:31:26,509 --> 00:31:29,721
Talaga? Ako everytime na may beauty
run, 'yan ang una. Wala kang idea ba't

359
00:31:29,804 --> 00:31:31,014
nagka-gano'n?

360
00:31:31,097 --> 00:31:32,348
-Hoy, hindi, ah!
-May ginawa ka ba para

361
00:31:32,432 --> 00:31:33,808
magalit s'ya? Kahit ano?

362
00:31:36,519 --> 00:31:37,729
Hindi ko alam.

363
00:31:37,812 --> 00:31:39,564
Hay, ano ba?

364
00:31:40,773 --> 00:31:42,025
Matutusta lang utak natin kaka-isip n'yan.

365
00:31:42,108 --> 00:31:44,485
Pero misteryo talaga ba't bigla na
lang naiinis ang mga babae sa 'tin.

366
00:31:44,569 --> 00:31:45,069
Ikaw, ah!

367
00:31:45,945 --> 00:31:50,575
Basta mag-sorry ka lang. "'Di ko
alam kasalanan ko pero sorry."

368
00:31:50,658 --> 00:31:52,493
Ta's magsasalita na 'yan:
"Actually ito'ng dahilan kung

369
00:31:52,577 --> 00:31:56,414
ba't ako nagalit." - Hay,
'di ko talaga gets kung ba't ganyan sila.

370
00:31:59,751 --> 00:32:00,919
Agree kay Choi Yun-seok.

371
00:32:01,502 --> 00:32:03,338
'Wag mo na pag-isipan,
mag-sorry ka na lang.

372
00:32:03,421 --> 00:32:06,174
Kaming girls minsan gusto
lang ng confirmation.

373
00:32:06,466 --> 00:32:07,717
"Confirmation"?

374
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:10,637
'Pag nagalit sila ng walang dahilan,
sabihin mo lang, - "I'm sorry, ah.

375
00:32:10,720 --> 00:32:13,264
'Di ko kaya kung wala ka. "

376
00:32:13,348 --> 00:32:14,974
Fantasy 'yan ng karamihan ng girls.

377
00:32:15,058 --> 00:32:16,059
Kahit si Jae-i?

378
00:32:16,142 --> 00:32:17,727
Girl din naman s'ya, 'di ba?

379
00:32:17,810 --> 00:32:18,937
Bukas mo na gawin.

380
00:32:19,020 --> 00:32:20,188
Do'n tayo sa vacation home.

381
00:32:20,271 --> 00:32:22,690
Sobrang tagal na,
mag-party naman tayo ulit.

382
00:32:22,774 --> 00:32:24,525
-Uy~, type ko 'yan~.
-Right?

383
00:32:24,609 --> 00:32:25,735
Mm-hm… Ano'ng gusto n'yong theme?

384
00:32:25,818 --> 00:32:26,819
-May kailangan kang dalhin.
-Huh?

385
00:32:26,903 --> 00:32:27,946
-Pwede 'ko mag-magic.
-Hala, o! 'Di naman

386
00:32:28,029 --> 00:32:29,155
-siguro s'ya uupo dito, 'no?
-Huy, paulit-ulit?

387
00:32:29,238 --> 00:32:30,323
-Iba naman.
-Okay, okay, okay.

388
00:32:30,406 --> 00:32:31,324
Talaga, ah?

389
00:32:31,908 --> 00:32:32,742
Hoy! Sira ka na ba?

390
00:32:36,955 --> 00:32:37,872
Tabi d'yan.

391
00:32:45,004 --> 00:32:48,800
Mr. Kang Ha, 'yung pagkakaiba ba
ng langit at lupa hindi mo alam?

392
00:32:49,133 --> 00:32:50,301
Ha, ako?

393
00:32:50,426 --> 00:32:53,346
Tumayo ka na agad kahit hindi pa
nakaka-alis si Ri-an sa auditorium.

394
00:32:53,429 --> 00:32:55,431
Umusyoso ka sa special classrooms
at music rooms.

395
00:32:55,515 --> 00:32:57,517
Umupo ka kahit sa'n mo gusto sa klase.

396
00:32:57,600 --> 00:32:58,810
Tapos ngayon…

397
00:32:58,893 --> 00:33:00,603
do'n sa bleachers ka sana uupo?

398
00:33:01,813 --> 00:33:03,648
Oo. Bakit? - May mali ba do'n?

399
00:33:04,232 --> 00:33:05,900
Para s'yang pure spring water, Chan-min.

400
00:33:05,984 --> 00:33:09,112
Malinaw ang mukha~, malabnaw ang
utak~, larawan ng walang-muwang.

401
00:33:09,195 --> 00:33:12,365
Nagtanong pa 'yan kung pa'no magpapalit
ng klase. Si Gil Ye-ji pa ang tinanong.

402
00:33:12,448 --> 00:33:14,951
Anak ng may-ari
Jooshin Mart, si Gil Ye-ji?

403
00:33:18,079 --> 00:33:18,997
Totoo ba 'yon?

404
00:33:19,747 --> 00:33:21,541
Ano namang gusto mong palitan?

405
00:33:21,624 --> 00:33:25,003
Ah kasi, napansin kong may
fencing at rowing classes pala.

406
00:33:25,795 --> 00:33:26,671
Gusto mong kunin?

407
00:33:26,754 --> 00:33:29,549
Wala kasing gano'ng classes sa dati kong
school, e. Pero mas magandang school 'to

408
00:33:29,632 --> 00:33:33,094
-na may mga gano'n kaya--
-Sa faculty room, do'n ka pumunta.

409
00:33:33,177 --> 00:33:36,889
Ang tanong nga lang… may
pambayad ka ba ng special class fees?

410
00:33:36,973 --> 00:33:39,058
'Yung rowing mga 40 million
won per semester

411
00:33:39,142 --> 00:33:41,352
- ta's 'yung fencing mas
mura lang ng konti do'n.

412
00:33:41,436 --> 00:33:42,437
Ano, 40 million won?

413
00:33:43,438 --> 00:33:44,897
Hala, - sobrang mahal pala, ah.

414
00:33:44,981 --> 00:33:45,982
Gano'n?

415
00:33:50,236 --> 00:33:52,405
Makinig kang mabuti sa 'kin, Kang Ha.

416
00:33:53,698 --> 00:33:56,492
Itong school na 'to - ibang-iba
sa mga naging school mo dati.

417
00:33:56,576 --> 00:33:58,745
May sariling rules dito sa Jooshin.

418
00:33:59,078 --> 00:34:00,204
At ano ang mga 'yon?

419
00:34:00,788 --> 00:34:03,291
'Wag na 'wag kang babangga ng kahit sino.

420
00:34:03,666 --> 00:34:04,584
Kahit sino?

421
00:34:04,667 --> 00:34:09,172
Si Jae-i, - He-ra, - Woo-jin, at lalong
lalo na si Ri-an. Hindi mo sila ka-level.

422
00:34:09,255 --> 00:34:10,715
Pa'no mo naman nasabi 'yan?

423
00:34:10,798 --> 00:34:13,092
Hindi pa ba obvious? - Iba sila sa 'tin.

424
00:34:13,176 --> 00:34:14,385
Tayo scholarship kids lang.

425
00:34:14,469 --> 00:34:16,387
Iba tayo sa kanila.

426
00:34:16,471 --> 00:34:20,099
Magkaiba'ng kulay ng neck ties
natin base sa status, para kitang-kita.

427
00:34:20,183 --> 00:34:22,894
'Pag scholar, kulay
navy, sa kanila maroon.

428
00:34:23,978 --> 00:34:27,273
'Yung maternal great-grandfather
ni Ri-an ang founder ng school,

429
00:34:27,356 --> 00:34:30,401
'yung iba legacy students
ng mga may-kayang pamilya.

430
00:34:30,777 --> 00:34:33,863
Kalolo-lolohan nila na
nag-aral at nag-contribute sa school.

431
00:34:33,946 --> 00:34:36,699
Advocacy nilang
makapasok mga tulad natin dito.

432
00:34:37,950 --> 00:34:40,745
Kaya 'di ba dapat lang
na respetuhin natin sila?

433
00:34:43,081 --> 00:34:43,915
Respetuhin…

434
00:34:44,040 --> 00:34:47,919
'Wag mo na isipin pa!
Ulit-ulitin mo sa sarili mo na:

435
00:34:48,002 --> 00:34:50,213
"'Di ako mang-gugulo.
" "'Di ako mang-uusyoso kung saan-saan.

436
00:34:50,296 --> 00:34:52,173
" "Sisiguruhin ko na 'di ako
makaka-abala sa kanila."

437
00:34:52,256 --> 00:34:53,758
Mahirap ba 'yung maintindihan?

438
00:34:53,841 --> 00:34:55,301
'Di sa gano'n. Kaya lang…

439
00:34:55,843 --> 00:34:57,845
Sige, basta. - 'Yung… respeto gets ko.

440
00:34:58,638 --> 00:35:01,140
Pwede naman tayong
maging magkakaibigan, e…

441
00:35:01,557 --> 00:35:04,018
Pero sobra namang
sabihing "'wag silang abalahin.

442
00:35:04,102 --> 00:35:06,354
Pucha, nasosobrahan ka na sa gano'n?

443
00:35:07,063 --> 00:35:10,358
Hoy, tandaan mo 'yang mga
sinabi mo. Ayokong magsisi ka.

444
00:35:16,447 --> 00:35:18,533
'Lam mo pa'no ka nakapasok dito, ah?

445
00:35:22,453 --> 00:35:25,414
Dahil nagakaro'n ng slot
para sa bagong scholar.

446
